  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of the Mozambique-Malawi Interconnector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Project consists of the construction of a 218 km long transmission line with a voltage level of 400 kV between Matambo, Tete Province, Mozambique, and Phombeya (Balaka District, Malawi). This Delagation Agreement covers the component within Malawi including: &#xbf;Installation of approx. 76 km of 400 kV transmission line &#xbf;Extension of Phombeya substation with transmission line bays.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
